ame":"continue","events":[{"on":"click","do":"a.continueFromReviewToProcess","metric":"t.continueAction"}]}},"a":{"continueFromReviewToProcess":{"url":"/hk-zh/shop/checkoutx/review?_a=continueFromReviewToProcess&_m=checkout.review","submit":true}},"t":{"continueAction":{"microEvents":[{"key":"eVar21","value":"transaction.co.action.place_order_now"}],"macroEvents":{"op":"JOIN","args":[",",true,{"if":{"get":"d.selfPickupContact.selfContact.address.isDaytimePhoneSelected"},"then":"event267","else":{"if":{"get":"d.thirdPartyPickupContact.billingContact.address.isDaytimePhoneSelected"},"then":"event267","else":""}},{"if":{"op":"EQ","args":[{"get":"d.pickupContactOptions.selectedPickupOption"},"SELF"]},"then":"event142","else":{"if":{"op":"EQ","args":[{"get":"d.pickupContactOptions.selectedPickupOption"},"THIRDPARTY"]},"then":"event143","else":""}}]}}},"c":["billingReview","footnotes","faq","fulfillmentReview","pickupContactReview","placeOrder","summary"],"billingReview":{"d":{"metricsEvar1":"Payment","layouts":[["cc-0"],["address"]],"metricsActionEvar1":"ChangePaymentDetails","editLabel":"更改","editLabelA11y":"更改付款詳情"},"b":{"edit":{"id":"checkout-review-billingReview-edit","events":[{"on":"click","do":"a.edit","metric":"t.changePaymentDetails"}]}},"a":{"edit":{"url":"/hk-zh/shop/checkoutx/review?_a=edit&_m=checkout.review.billingReview","submit":true,"module":"/checkout","validate":false}},"t":{"changePaymentDetails":{"microEvents":[{"key":"prop37","value":"ChangePaymentDetails","feature":"Payment"}]}},"c":["cc-0","address"],"cc-0":{"d":{"paymentTypeLabel":"Visa","paymentType":"VISA","cardNumber":"•••6596","category":"CREDIT_CARD","header":"透過以下方式即時付清："}},"address":{"d":{"showLocationConsent":true,"street2":"Bank Bldg","lastName":"CHAN","firstName":"TAI MAN","countryCode":"香港","mode":"VIEW","street":"Central","layout":[{"sectionHeader":"帳單地址：","fields":[[{"name":"lastName","type":"text","label":"姓氏"},{"name":"firstName","type":"text","label":"名字"}],[{"name":"street","type":"text","label":"區域/地區/街道名稱及號碼"}],[{"name":"street2","type":"text","label":"屋苑或大廈/座數/樓層/單位"}],[{"name":"countryCode","type":"text","label":"國家/地區"}]]}]}}},"footnotes":{"d":{"hasPartnerFinanceInstallment":false,"hasAppleCreatorStudio":false,"bugattiTradeInFootNotes":["  "],"isInvoicing":false,"isInstallmentsUpgradeAvailable":false,"tradeInDisclaimerEnabled":false}},"faq":{"d":{"faq":[{"question":"我何時會收到產品？","answer":"提交訂單後，你將會收到最終確認的送貨日期。預計送貨時間視乎產品供應狀況和所選的送貨選項而定。如要取貨，你需要在結帳時選擇取貨日期和零售店。\u003Ca href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk-zh/shop/help/shipping_delivery\" data-feature-name=\"Astro Link\" data-display-name=\"AOS: help/shipping_delivery\" class=\"icon-wrapper\" target=\"_blank\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"icon-copy\"\u003E進一步了解 Apple 送貨及取貨\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"visuallyhidden\"\u003E (以新視窗開啟)\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"more\"\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E"},{"question":"我何時可以提取訂單？","answer":"當產品準備妥當並可供取貨時，我們會傳送電郵通知你。在此之前，產品並未備妥。現貨產品通常在一小時內便已準備妥當。為確保你可享輕鬆快捷的零售店體驗，部分取貨訂單會要求你選擇取貨時間。當你的訂單準備就緒可供取貨時，如果你取消訂單或未有在網上訂單狀態顯示的到期日前取貨，我們會向你收取 15% 的退貨費用。\u003Ca href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk-zh/shop/help/shipping_delivery\" data-feature-name=\"Astro Link\" data-display-name=\"AOS: help/shipping_delivery\" class=\"icon-wrapper\" target=\"_blank\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"icon-copy\"\u003E進一步了解 Apple 送貨及取貨\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"visuallyhidden\"\u003E (以新視窗開啟)\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"more\"\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E "},{"question":"我可以前往 Apple Store 取貨嗎？","answer":"可以。如果你選擇取貨，你需要在結帳時選擇零售店和取貨日期。取貨服務並不是適用於所有產品。產品準備妥當可供取貨時，我們會向你傳送訊息。提交訂單後，你將無法更改取貨資料，因此請確保你所輸入的資料準確無誤。請攜同政府簽發的附相片有效身份證明文件，身份證明文件上的姓名須與在取貨聯絡人表格中輸入的一致。\u003Ca href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk-zh/shop/help/shipping_delivery\" data-feature-name=\"Astro Link\" data-display-name=\"AOS: help/shipping_delivery\" class=\"icon-wrapper\" target=\"_blank\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"icon-copy\"\u003E進一步了解 Apple 送貨及取貨\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"visuallyhidden\"\u003E (以新視窗開啟)\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"more\"\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E"},{"question":"我會收到訊息通知嗎？","answer":"在結帳時輸入你的手提電話號碼，即可在產品出貨、準備妥當可供取貨和訂單出現問題時收到訊息。訊息僅會在上午 6 時至晚上 10 時傳送。要停止接收訊息通知，以「停止」回覆訊息即可。"},{"question":"如果我無法親自收貨，該怎麼辦？","answer":"訂單的出貨電郵會提示你是否須要在收貨時簽名。屆時如果你不能親自收貨，速遞公司便會留下通知書，而我們亦會透過電郵通知你。你可直接聯絡速遞公司以安排新的收貨時間，或提供另一個地址。\u003Ca href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk-zh/shop/help/shipping_delivery\" data-feature-name=\"Astro Link\" data-display-name=\"AOS: help/shipping_delivery\" class=\"icon-wrapper\" target=\"_blank\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"icon-copy\"\u003E進一步了解 Apple 送貨及取貨\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"visuallyhidden\"\u003E (以新視窗開啟)\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"more\"\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E"},{"question":"為什麼結帳後需要認證信用卡？","answer":"為提供額外安全保障，當你在 apple.com 或 Apple&nbsp;Store app 使用扣帳卡或信用卡購物付款時，有可能需要輸入特殊的安全碼。結帳時，系統會提示你輸入安全碼以完成交易。你的發卡機構會透過電子郵件或文字短訊傳送安全碼給你。如果沒有收到安全碼，請聯絡你的發卡機構。部分情況下，你會收到指示登入銀行 app，以驗證交易。\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk-zh/shop/help/payments\"\u003E進一步了解使用扣帳卡或信用卡結帳&gt;\u003C/a\u003E"}],"faqTitle":"檢查步驟的常見疑問"}},"fulfillmentReview":{"c":["reviewGroup-1"],"reviewGroup-1":{"d":{"pickup":{"quote":"店內取貨: 明天 - Apple Canton Road","timeslot":"提取時段: 19:00 – 19:15"},"editLabel":"更改零售店","editLabelA11y":"Change the pickup store"},"b":{"edit":{"id":"review-group-1-edit","events":[{"on":"click","do":"a.edit","metric":"t.changeStore"}]}},"a":{"edit":{"url":"/hk-zh/shop/checkoutx/review?_a=edit&_m=checkout.review.fulfillmentReview.reviewGroup-1","submit":true,"module":"/checkout","validate":false}},"t":{"changeStore":{"microEvents":[{"key":"prop37","value":"ChangeStore","feature":"Pickup"}]}},"c":["item-e15844bf-b205-47f4-8536-d8db3eb50e92","item-19ed522a-bd34-4ecb-8fd7-2f20d44cf168"],"item-e15844bf-b205-47f4-8536-d8db3eb50e92":{"f":{"abstract":"/abs.CartItem"},"d":{"hasCloudSubscription":false,"productUrl":"https:/